### get userinfo with auth_token
GET {{ WLS_AUTH_SERVICE }}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}

### GET wahlbezirkID
GET {{ WLS_WAHLVORBEREITUNG_SERVICE_URL }}/businessActions/briefwahlvorbereitung/wahlbezirkID
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}

### GET wahlbezirkID1
